# gateway.env -- the Ollama Gateway's laptop-side single source of truth
# (docs/design/OLLAMA-GATEWAY.DESIGN.md, Data Model). POSIX sh syntax.
#
# Sourced by libexec/launch-ollama.zsh, and -- installed by setup.sh as
# routes/ollama-gateway.env -- by the LMDE proxy layer's launcher, which
# exports it to HAProxy for routes/ollama-gateway.cfg. Each value can be
# overridden from the environment (tests do); launchd sets none of them.

# The external ollama's loopback port. Never 11434 (the everyday ollama).
OLLAMA_GATEWAY_OLLAMA_PORT="${OLLAMA_GATEWAY_OLLAMA_PORT:-11435}"

# The deadline proxy's loopback port: the gateway route's one listener on
# the LMDE proxy layer (Q12). tds-internal ops/terraform/ollama-gateway
# mirrors this by hand as origin_port; the healthcheck's drift probe (Q8)
# catches a mismatch.
OLLAMA_GATEWAY_PROXY_PORT="${OLLAMA_GATEWAY_PROXY_PORT:-11436}"

# First byte to the caller before this, or the deadline answer (HTTP 507).
# Cloudflare's proxy read timeout -- its time-to-first-byte limit -- is
# 100 s on this plan; 90 s leaves 10 s for the tunnel and the edge.
OLLAMA_GATEWAY_DEADLINE="${OLLAMA_GATEWAY_DEADLINE:-90s}"

# How long the route keeps the upstream request open after the caller has
# gone (deadline answer or disconnect), so a model load in progress
# finishes: ollama aborts a load whose requester disconnects. Above
# ollama's own 5 m OLLAMA_LOAD_TIMEOUT, so ollama gives up first.
OLLAMA_GATEWAY_HOLD="${OLLAMA_GATEWAY_HOLD:-6m}"

# Q3: unload promptly after a review. A review's requests arrive seconds
# apart and a caller's retry after the deadline answer comes within its
# backoff, so 2 m covers both and still frees the model (~23 GB for the
# default) two minutes after the last request, against ollama's 5 m default.
OLLAMA_GATEWAY_KEEP_ALIVE="${OLLAMA_GATEWAY_KEEP_ALIVE:-2m}"

# Bounded memory: ollama 0.40 sizes the default context from VRAM (256k on
# a 64 GB M1 Max), which makes one model's KV cache rival its weights.
# 32k fits a review prompt with room for the completion.
OLLAMA_GATEWAY_CONTEXT_LENGTH="${OLLAMA_GATEWAY_CONTEXT_LENGTH:-32768}"
